      "role": "user",
      "content": "I am currently conducting a detailed analysis of the stochasticity involved in microbial community assembly within sourdough starters. Could you explain the metabolic interference mechanisms that occur during the transition from a monoculture to a complex stable community? Specifically, I am looking for a technical breakdown of how metabolic byproducts from early-stage colonizers create selective pressures that dictate the assembly of the final, stable microbial consortium.",
